verdict good
note "eval-coverage-3 first reference, read frame by frame: at 1.5 the bottom-anchored OSD pill (margin 64, shadow 0 10px 24px) slides up, its meter and rolled percentage change twice and it leaves, its box 64 px above the edge throughout; the left dock's shadow (8px 0 18px) falls right of it while its running dot widens; re-read at eval-finish (hidden-row look: a node hidden at opacity 0 is traced at its own scale and turn): k1 and k142 the osd's rows hidden at opacity 0 now at scale 0.9, where they read 1; nothing else differs"
